cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you utilize this codebase or research findings in your research, please cite both the software repository and the underlying source dataset."
title: "IVF Insight: Exploratory Clinical Data Analysis, Predictive Modelling and Temporal Validation of IVF Treatment-Cycle Outcomes"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-01
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: "R"
    given-names: "Simpson"
repository-code: "https://github.com/your-username/ivf-insight"
abstract: "A rigorous, reproducible clinical data science and machine learning investigation into assisted reproductive technology (ART) cycle outcomes using an authoritative cohort of 5,000 candidate treatment cycles. Incorporates strict prospective chronological validation (2024-01-01 cutoff), milestone-based feature governance, multivariable odds ratio estimation, canonical calibration auditing, and deconstruction of the Conflation Illusion and Female Age suppression effects."
keywords:
  - "in-vitro-fertilization"
  - "clinical-prediction-models"
  - "temporal-validation"
  - "calibration-drift"
  - "reproducible-research"
  - "biomedical-data-science"
